     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Pilot Implementation for Bursa MF 
Delivery of awareness raising programs completed. 
SMEs are identified for pilot implementations
Training of the Trainers Program were delivered.
Implementation of Learn and Transform Programs in selected companies completed.
2. Establishment of Kayseri and Konya MFs and Pilot Implementations
Governance Structure has been completed
Physical Investments (refurbishment&amp;machinery) have been completed
Staff have been mobilized.
Awareness raising programs have been launched.
Pilot SMEs have been identified.
Training of the Trainers Program have been completed. 
 Learn and Transform Programs in selected companies have been launched. 
3. Completion of required physical investment in Ankara
Deployment of hardware, software and IoT platforms and service integration and admission tests have been conducted. 
4. Job creation 
1448 jobs have been created in Ankara, Kayseri and Konya through interventions on vocational trainings, entrepreneurship programs and matchmaking activities.</narrative>
